## Command

```shell
biome lint --only=style/useFilenamingConvention AstroComponent.astro
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "html": {
    "experimentalFullSupportEnabled": true,
    "linter": { "enabled": true }
  },
  "linter": {
    "rules": {
      "preset": "none",
      "style": { "useFilenamingConvention": "error" }
    }
  }
}
```

## `AstroComponent.astro`

```astro
<main>
  <h1>Markup only</h1>
</main>

```

